{"context": "published", "host": "www.josephsmithpapers.org", "showHeader": true, "footerStyle": "mini", "statusCode": 200, "uri": "letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833", "page": "6", "is404": false, "gallery": [{"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_070_thumb.jpg", "page": "1", "label": "70", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/1"}, {"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_071_thumb.jpg", "page": "2", "label": "71", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/2"}, {"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_072_thumb.jpg", "page": "3", "label": "72", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/3"}, {"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_073_thumb.jpg", "page": "4", "label": "73", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/4"}, {"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_074_thumb.jpg", "page": "5", "label": "74", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/5"}, {"image": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075_thumb.jpg", "page": "6", "label": "75", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/6"}], "tableOfContents": [], "summary": {"uri": "letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833", "series": "JSPPD", "urlTitleValue": "JSPPD3", "documentSeriesTitle": "Letter to Edward Partridge and Others, 10 December 1833", "editorialPageNumber": "75", "isPageNumberPresent": true, "searchUrl": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/30495/30495-0006.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> other place should be appointed like unto this<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13033574000933425282\"><a href=\"#13033574000933425282\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans35\"><span id=\"documenttrans35\">35</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">Revelation, ca. 7 Mar. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 45:65–66]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 20 July 1831 [D&amp;C\n57]\">Revelation, 20 July 1831</a> [D&amp;C 57:1–3]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/plat-of-the-city-of-zion-circa-early-june-25-june-1833\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/plat-of-the-city-of-zion-circa-early-june-25-june-1833\" poptitle=\"Plat\n of the City of Zion,\n circa Early\n June–25\n June 1833\">Plat of the City of Zion, ca. Early June–25 June 1833</a>; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-16-17-december-1833-dc-101\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-16-17-december-1833-dc-101\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 16–17 December 1833 [D&amp;C\n101]\">Revelation, 16–17 Dec. 1833</a> [D&amp;C 101:20].</p><hr></div></div></aside> therefore I ask thee in the name of Jesus Christ, to return thy people unto their homes, &amp; there <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"3098041965655763537\"><a href=\"#3098041965655763537\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x6228\" topic=\"x6228\" title=\"Inheritance\">inheritances</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Inheritance\"><p>Generally referred to land promised by or received from God for the church and its members. A January 1831 revelation promised church members a land of inheritance. In March and May 1831, JS dictated revelations commanding members “to purchase lands for an...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/inheritance\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside>, to enjoy the fruit of their Labors; that all the waste places<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13059648938850736905\"><a href=\"#13059648938850736905\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans36\"><span id=\"documenttrans36\">36</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 51:3.</p><hr></div></div></aside> may be built up; that all the enemies of thy people, who will not repent and turn unto thee be distroyed from off the face of that Land; and let an <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"2903392410639419744\"><a href=\"#2903392410639419744\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x4090\" topic=\"x4090\" title=\"House of the Lord\">house</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"House of the Lord\"><p>The official name for the sacred edifice in Kirtland, Ohio, later known as the Kirtland temple; also the official name for other planned religious structures in Missouri. JS and the Latter-day Saints also referred to the House of the Lord in Kirtland as “...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/house-of-the-lord\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> be built and established unto thy name, and let all the losses that thy people have sustained be rewarded unto them, even more than fourfold;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"138380976665097190\"><a href=\"#138380976665097190\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans37\"><span id=\"documenttrans37\">37</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Luke 19:8; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-6-august-1833-dc-98\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-6-august-1833-dc-98\" poptitle=\"Revelation,\n6 August 1833 [D&amp;C\n98]\">Revelation, 6 Aug. 1833</a> [D&amp;C 98:26].</p><hr></div></div></aside> that the borders of <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"17937745784481455850\"><a href=\"#17937745784481455850\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x4116\" topic=\"x4116\" title=\"Zion\">Zion</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Zion\"><p>A specific location in Missouri; also a literal or figurative gathering of believers in Jesus Christ, characterized by adherence to ideals of harmony, equality, and purity. In JS’s earliest revelations “the cause of Zion” was used to broadly describe the ...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/zion\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> be enlarged forever,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13640793871732534197\"><a href=\"#13640793871732534197\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans38\"><span id=\"documenttrans38\">38</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-26-april-1832-dc-82\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-26-april-1832-dc-82\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 26 April 1832\n[D&amp;C 82]\">Revelation, 26 Apr. 1832</a> [D&amp;C 82:14].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and let her be established no more to be thrown down;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1399601428075576439\"><a href=\"#1399601428075576439\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans39\"><span id=\"documenttrans39\">39</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Jeremiah 31:40.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and let all thy saints when they are scattered as sheep, and are persecuted, flee unto Zion,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7852248633032276393\"><a href=\"#7852248633032276393\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans40\"><span id=\"documenttrans40\">40</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">In March 1831, JS dictated a <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">revelation</a> that stated that <a href=\"/topic/zion\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Zion</a> would be “a land of peace a City of refuge a place of safety for the saints of The most high God” and that even unbelievers, for survival in the turbulent days before Christ’s second coming, “must needs flee unto Zion for safety.” (<a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">Revelation, ca. 7 Mar. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 45:66, 68].)</p><hr></div></div></aside> and be established in the midst of her, and let her be organized according to thy law<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"8202996908123575833\"><a href=\"#8202996908123575833\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans41\"><span id=\"documenttrans41\">41</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-9-february-1831-dc-421-72\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-9-february-1831-dc-421-72\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 9\nFebruary 1831 [D&amp;C 42:1–72]\">Revelation, 9</a> and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-23-february-1831-dc-4274-93\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-23-february-1831-dc-4274-93\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 23 February 1831 [D&amp;C\n42:74–93]\">23 Feb. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 42].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and let this prayer even be recorded before thy face; give thy holy spirit unto my brethren: unto whom I write: send thy angels to guard them and to deliver them from all evil; and when they turn there faces towards Zion<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"5677368948640109694\"><a href=\"#5677368948640109694\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans42\"><span id=\"documenttrans42\">42</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Jeremiah 50:5.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and bow down before thee and pray may their sins never come up before thy face neither have place in the book of thy remembrance<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13020604201816413733\"><a href=\"#13020604201816413733\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans43\"><span id=\"documenttrans43\">43</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Malachi 3:16; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/letter-to-william-w-phelps-27-november-1832\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/letter-to-william-w-phelps-27-november-1832\" poptitle=\"Letter to William W. Phelps, 27\nNovember 1832\">Letter to William W. Phelps, 27 Nov. 1832</a> [D&amp;C 85:9].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and may they depart from all their eniquities. provide food for them as thou doest for the ravens,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"9168115119389544254\"><a href=\"#9168115119389544254\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans44\"><span id=\"documenttrans44\">44</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 38:41.</p><hr></div></div></aside> provide clothing to cover there nakedness, and houses that they may dwell therein give unto them friends in abundance, and let their names be recorded in the Lambs book of Life<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"2908701898619924290\"><a href=\"#2908701898619924290\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans45\"><span id=\"documenttrans45\">45</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Revelation 21:27.</p><hr></div></div></aside> eternally before thy face Amen finely [finally], brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you all unto his coming and Kingdom, Amen</div> <div class=\"right wasptag\"><span class=\"underscore\">Joseph Smith J</span> [p. 75]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\"> other place should be appointed like unto this<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"6925715724737228727\"><a href=\"#6925715724737228727\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans35\"><span id=\"documenttrans35\">35</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">Revelation, ca. 7 Mar. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 45:65–66]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 20 July 1831 [D&amp;C\n57]\">Revelation, 20 July 1831</a> [D&amp;C 57:1–3]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/plat-of-the-city-of-zion-circa-early-june-25-june-1833\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/plat-of-the-city-of-zion-circa-early-june-25-june-1833\" poptitle=\"Plat\n of the City of Zion,\n circa Early\n June–25\n June 1833\">Plat of the City of Zion, ca. Early June–25 June 1833</a>; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-16-17-december-1833-dc-101\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-16-17-december-1833-dc-101\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 16–17 December 1833 [D&amp;C\n101]\">Revelation, 16–17 Dec. 1833</a> [D&amp;C 101:20].</p><hr></div></div></aside> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>therefore I ask thee in the name of Jesus Christ, <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>to return thy people unto their homes, &amp; there <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1001902483779236919\"><a href=\"#1001902483779236919\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x6228\" topic=\"x6228\" title=\"Inheritance\">inher<span class=\"line-break hyphenate\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>itances</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Inheritance\"><p>Generally referred to land promised by or received from God for the church and its members. A January 1831 revelation promised church members a land of inheritance. In March and May 1831, JS dictated revelations commanding members “to purchase lands for an...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/inheritance\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside>, to enjoy the fruit of their Labors; that all <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>the waste places<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"6332865953694317451\"><a href=\"#6332865953694317451\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans36\"><span id=\"documenttrans36\">36</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 51:3.</p><hr></div></div></aside> may be built up; that all <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>the enemies of thy people, who will not <span class=\"deleted\">return</span> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>repent and <span class=\"deleted\">re</span>turn unto thee be distroyed from <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>off the face of that Land; and let an <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"8132465421746321712\"><a href=\"#8132465421746321712\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x4090\" topic=\"x4090\" title=\"House of the Lord\">house</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"House of the Lord\"><p>The official name for the sacred edifice in Kirtland, Ohio, later known as the Kirtland temple; also the official name for other planned religious structures in Missouri. JS and the Latter-day Saints also referred to the House of the Lord in Kirtland as “...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/house-of-the-lord\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> be built <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and established unto thy name, and let all <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>the losses that thy people have sustained be rewarded <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>unto them, even more than fourfold;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"73483630923890053\"><a href=\"#73483630923890053\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans37\"><span id=\"documenttrans37\">37</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Luke 19:8; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-6-august-1833-dc-98\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-6-august-1833-dc-98\" poptitle=\"Revelation,\n6 August 1833 [D&amp;C\n98]\">Revelation, 6 Aug. 1833</a> [D&amp;C 98:26].</p><hr></div></div></aside> that the bor<span class=\"line-break hyphenate\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>ders of <aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"14112783616252036606\"><a href=\"#14112783616252036606\" class=\"reference staticPopup\" ro=\"x4116\" topic=\"x4116\" title=\"Zion\">Zion</a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data\" isnote=\"Y\" isnonsearchable=\"Y\"><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"Zion\"><p>A specific location in Missouri; also a literal or figurative gathering of believers in Jesus Christ, characterized by adherence to ideals of harmony, equality, and purity. In JS’s earliest revelations “the cause of Zion” was used to broadly describe the ...</p><a class=\"more\" href=\"/topic/zion\">View Glossary</a></div></div></aside> be enlarged forever,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1953448942385269851\"><a href=\"#1953448942385269851\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans38\"><span id=\"documenttrans38\">38</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-26-april-1832-dc-82\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-26-april-1832-dc-82\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 26 April 1832\n[D&amp;C 82]\">Revelation, 26 Apr. 1832</a> [D&amp;C 82:14].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and let her <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>be established no more to be thrown down;<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"17443935242290062599\"><a href=\"#17443935242290062599\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans39\"><span id=\"documenttrans39\">39</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Jeremiah 31:40.</p><hr></div></div></aside> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and let all thy saints when they are scattered <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>as sheep, and are persecuted, <span class=\"deleted\">and</span> flee unto <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Zion,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"8056501357064781160\"><a href=\"#8056501357064781160\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans40\"><span id=\"documenttrans40\">40</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">In March 1831, JS dictated a <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">revelation</a> that stated that <a href=\"/topic/zion\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Zion</a> would be “a land of peace a City of refuge a place of safety for the saints of The most high God” and that even unbelievers, for survival in the turbulent days before Christ’s second coming, “must needs flee unto Zion for safety.” (<a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">Revelation, ca. 7 Mar. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 45:66, 68].)</p><hr></div></div></aside> and be established in the midst <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>of her, and let her be organized according <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>to thy law<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"1623151669589331837\"><a href=\"#1623151669589331837\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans41\"><span id=\"documenttrans41\">41</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-9-february-1831-dc-421-72\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-9-february-1831-dc-421-72\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 9\nFebruary 1831 [D&amp;C 42:1–72]\">Revelation, 9</a> and <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-23-february-1831-dc-4274-93\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-23-february-1831-dc-4274-93\" poptitle=\"Revelation, 23 February 1831 [D&amp;C\n42:74–93]\">23 Feb. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 42].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and let this prayer even <span class=\"deleted\">before</span> be <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>recorded before thy face; give thy holy spirit <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>unto my brethren: unto whom I write: send <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>thy angels to guard them and to deliver them <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>from all evil; and when they turn there faces <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>towards Zion<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"4885900621048519550\"><a href=\"#4885900621048519550\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans42\"><span id=\"documenttrans42\">42</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Jeremiah 50:5.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and bow down before thee and pray <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>may their sins never com[e] up before thy face <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>neithe[r] have place in the book of thy remem<span class=\"line-break hyphenate\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>brance<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"15484613336650056652\"><a href=\"#15484613336650056652\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans43\"><span id=\"documenttrans43\">43</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Malachi 3:16; and <a href=\"/paper-summary/letter-to-william-w-phelps-27-november-1832\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/letter-to-william-w-phelps-27-november-1832\" poptitle=\"Letter to William W. Phelps, 27\nNovember 1832\">Letter to William W. Phelps, 27 Nov. 1832</a> [D&amp;C 85:9].</p><hr></div></div></aside> and may they depart from all their <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>eniquities. provide <span class=\"deleted\">bread</span> &lt;​food​&gt; for them as thou doest <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>for the ravens,<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"5369878371905200471\"><a href=\"#5369878371905200471\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans44\"><span id=\"documenttrans44\">44</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 38:41.</p><hr></div></div></aside> provide clothing to cover there <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>nakedness, and &lt;​houses that they may​&gt; <span class=\"deleted\">cause that they</span> dwell therein <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>give unto them friends in abundance, and <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>let their names be recorded in the Lambs <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>book of Life<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7645283631058925441\"><a href=\"#7645283631058925441\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans45\"><span id=\"documenttrans45\">45</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Revelation 21:27.</p><hr></div></div></aside> eternally before thy face Amen <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>finely [finally], brethren, the grace of our Lord Jesus <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Christ be with you all unto his coming and <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>Kingdom, Amen</div> <div class=\"right wasptag\"><span class=\"underscore\">Joseph Smith J</span> [p. 75]</div></body></html>", "calendarsOfDocuments": [], "versions": [{"versionTitle": "Letter to Edward Partridge and Others, 10 December 1833", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letter-to-edward-partridge-and-others-10-december-1833/1", "versionFeatured": "true"}, {"versionTitle": "Letterbook 1", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letterbook-1/82", "versionFeatured": ""}, {"versionTitle": "History, 1838–1856, volume A-1 [23 December 1805–30 August 1834]", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/history-1838-1856-volume-a-1-23-december-1805-30-august-1834/398", "versionFeatured": ""}, {"versionTitle": "“History of Joseph Smith”", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/history-of-joseph-smith/213", "versionFeatured": ""}], "images": {"smallImageUrl": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075_thumb.jpg", "mediumImageUrl": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075_med.jpg", "largeImageUrl": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075.jpg", "downloadImageUrl": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075_download.jpg"}, "imageCredit": "", "facsimile": "", "dzUrlXml": "/7633/7633_ms155_2_01_lb1_075.xml", "classification": "Documents", "publishedStatus": "FinalContent", "accessionNumber": "192", "requestedPageNumber": "6", "numberOfPages": "6", "editorialTitle": "Letter to Edward Partridge and Others, 10 December 1833", "cleanEditorialTitle": "Letter to Edward Partridge and Others, 10 December 1833", "date": "December 10, 1833", "handwriting": "No handwriting information was found.", "footnotes": [{"id": "6925715724737228727", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\">See <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-circa-7-march-1831-dc-45\" poptitle=\"Revelation, circa 7 March 1831 [D&amp;C\n45]\">Revelation, ca. 7 Mar. 1831</a> [D&amp;C 45:65–66]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-20-july-1831-dc-57\" popt